# Docker build context for deploy/portal.Dockerfile and
# deploy/seo-worker.Dockerfile (both COPY . .).
# Excludes only what the build and runtime never read. The image reinstalls
# dependencies with npm ci and rebuilds the client, so local copies of those
# are dead weight. Production variables come from Railway at run time, never
# from a file in the image.
.git
**/node_modules
waves-customer-portal.tar.gz
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/coverage
.nyc_output
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
**/*.log
